[Tool Performance & Latency] Calculate the average and maximum execution latency per tool, sorted by the slowest tools first.
==============================================================================
Analyzing context
Retrieving context for 26 tables.
Context retrieved
Retrieved context for 26 tables.
Running a query
SELECT tool_name,
       ROUND(AVG(total_ms)) AS avg_latency_ms,
       MAX(total_ms) AS max_latency_ms
FROM `antigravity-503007.agent_telemetry.v_tool_completed`
WHERE timestamp >= TIMESTAMP_SUB(CURRENT_TIMESTAMP(), INTERVAL 7 DAY)
GROUP BY tool_name
ORDER BY avg_latency_ms DESC
Query execution completed
