==============================================================================
[Tool Invocations Distribution] Show the top 3 most frequently invoked tools and their percentage distribution.
==============================================================================
Analyzing context
Retrieved context for 26 tables.
Running a query
WITH tool_counts AS
  (SELECT tool_name,
          COUNT(*) AS invocation_count
   FROM `antigravity-503007.agent_telemetry.v_tool_starting`
   WHERE timestamp >= TIMESTAMP_SUB(CURRENT_TIMESTAMP(), INTERVAL 7 DAY)
   GROUP BY tool_name),
     total AS
  (SELECT SUM(invocation_count) AS total_invocations
   FROM tool_counts)
SELECT tc.tool_name,
       tc.invocation_count,
       ROUND(SAFE_DIVIDE(tc.invocation_count, t.total_invocations) * 100, 2) AS percentage
FROM tool_counts tc,
     total t
ORDER BY tc.invocation_count DESC
LIMIT 3
Query execution completed
Query returned 3 rows in 1.47s.
I applied a default time window of the last 7 days (since September 4, 2026) to prune partition data and ensure optimal query performance.
The top 3 most frequently invoked tools over the last 7 days are **pos_troubleshooting_rag_tool** (44.44%), **cymbal_analytics_tool** (41.67%), and **read_cashier_realtime_metrics** (13.89%).

  --- Generated GoogleSQL ---
  WITH tool_counts AS
    (SELECT tool_name,
            COUNT(*) AS invocation_count
     FROM `antigravity-503007.agent_telemetry.v_tool_starting`
     WHERE timestamp >= TIMESTAMP_SUB(CURRENT_TIMESTAMP(), INTERVAL 7 DAY)
     GROUP BY tool_name),
       total AS
    (SELECT SUM(invocation_count) AS total_invocations
     FROM tool_counts)
  SELECT tc.tool_name,
         tc.invocation_count,
         ROUND(SAFE_DIVIDE(tc.invocation_count, t.total_invocations) * 100, 2) AS percentage
  FROM tool_counts tc,
       total t
  ORDER BY tc.invocation_count DESC
  LIMIT 3

